## 11. EXPLANATION OF OUTPUT

The program accepts four courses: C, Cpp, Java, and Python. Three links are created: C to Cpp, Cpp to Java, and Cpp to Python. The adjacency list displays these connections. When the user selects Cpp, the program displays Java and Python because they are directly linked to Cpp.

